WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.450 line:88%
github.com → Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.774 line:88%
Tokens (classic) → Generate new token (classic).

3
00:00:07.824 --> 00:00:12.921 line:88%
Tick the scopes: repo, workflow, gist, delete_repo; read:org for organisations.

4
00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:17.538 line:88%
Generate token → copy the ghp_… token (GitHub shows it only once).

5
00:00:17.588 --> 00:00:21.509 line:88%
Settings → Integrations → GitHub. Detailed help is below.

6
00:00:21.559 --> 00:00:26.619 line:88%
Paste the token. A fine-grained one (github_pat_…) works too.

7
00:00:26.669 --> 00:00:31.413 line:88%
«Save» and «Test connection» — MemuAI tells you which rights are missing.

8
00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:37.590 line:88%
Done: «read the README of my repository».
